<title>USA: Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA, Calif. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three	 For the Three</p>
<p>				     Months Ended	  Months Ended</p>
<p>					  March 31,	     March 31,</p>
<p>					1997 (A)  1996 (A)     1996 (B)</p>
<p> Revenues			   $ 61,105  $ 53,831     $ 45,542</p>
<p> Operating expenses		 35,572    34,067	 27,434</p>
<p> Operating income		   25,533    19,764	 18,108</p>
<p>Equity in earnings of</p>
<p>  joint ventures		     4,135     4,644	  4,644</p>
<p> Investment income and other     3,486     2,130	  1,863</p>
<p> Income before taxes		33,154    26,538	 24,615</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes     11,272     7,630	  7,630</p>
<p> Net income			   21,882    18,908	 16,985</p>
<p> Earnings per share		   0.53	0.46	   0.45</p>
<p>(A)  Results reflect the combined operations of Watson and Oclassen</p>
<p>(B)  Results exclude the operations of Oclassen</p>
</text>
